---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Home" description="Modern static website for a coffee roastery">
  <section class="space-y-10">
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-amber-300">Small-batch roastery</p>
      <h2 class="max-w-3xl text-5xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-6xl">Fresh coffee, fast loading, low maintenance.</h2>
      <p class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">A static site built with Astro is perfect for a coffee brand that updates only every few months. It is secure, fast, and easy to deploy.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row">
        <a href="/about" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-amber-400 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-amber-300">Learn more</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-6 py-3 text-sm text-slate-100 transition hover:border-slate-500">Contact us</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/80 p-8 shadow-sm shadow-slate-950/50">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Static first</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300">No server-side backend required. Deploy on GitHub Pages, Cloudflare Pages, or Vercel for free or very low cost.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/80 p-8 shadow-sm shadow-slate-950/50">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Easy updates</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300">Update page content in code or connect a headless CMS later for non-technical editing.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/80 p-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-semibold">Home</h4>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-300">Showcase your story, coffee lineup, and contact details.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-semibold">About</h4>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-300">Share origin, roasting philosophy, and the roastery vision.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-semibold">Contact</h4>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-300">Include a simple inquiry section and link to maps or social feeds.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/80 p-8">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Small-batch craftsmanship</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-300">Every roast is blended and prepared with attention to origin, roast profile, and freshness. We keep production lean so each bag delivers the best tasting notes.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-300">Whether you are looking for a bright single origin or a velvety espresso blend, our curated collection makes it simple to bring premium coffee into your kitchen.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/80 p-8 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <article>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Seasonal blends</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300">Explore rotating seasonal options crafted from responsibly sourced beans and roasted to highlight crisp, balanced flavor.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Subscribe for news</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300">Stay in the loop with new releases, tasting notes, and special offers. Perfect for coffee lovers who want to try something fresh every month.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
